{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-janayen-avenue","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"janayen-avenue-dubai-investments-mirdif","about":"Janayen Avenue by developer Dubai Investments is a luxury project located in the Mirdif Hills neighborhood, offering 1-3 bedroom apartments and 3-4 bedroom duplexes. The complex is an ideal place to live, work and relax.One of the features of the complex is its architecture with urban design of common public spaces. It offers a unique combination of residential and commercial spaces, decorated in a modern style and surrounded by nature.There are picturesque parks and gardens with entertainment and recreational facilities. The complex offers stunning views of Mushrif Park, a family-friendly park offering a range of facilities including bike paths, entertainment areas, soccer fields, theater shows, barbecue area and much more.With its convenient location, residents of Janayen can reach Dubai Festival City and Dubai International Airport in just 15 minutes, while Dubai International Financial Centre and Dubai Mall are within a 20-minute drive.","price":3659603,"title":"Janayen Avenue","bitrix":{"id":628,"pf_id":"are.3.8911","source":null,"project_id":"Mirdif Hills","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Janayen Avenue","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Dubai Investments","project_location":"Mirdif"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/659/images/2024/01/07/340x252/GmniE02nof3PpeOGtE4PwQ6YoAmMUdpuJLphQtgo.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/659/images/2024/01/07/464x312/GmniE02nof3PpeOGtE4PwQ6YoAmMUdpuJLphQtgo.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2254838,"lng":55.4387052},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/659/images/2024/01/07/340x252/A09cx8tZAum1UDrtYCTXD7aI79GSu1hHdfSHr7X2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwp